  m_Name: TechnicalHearMore01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hearMoreName: TechnicalHearMore01
  hearMoreText: Technical sustainability is the ability of a system to keep functioning
    efficiently over time, even as technology, user needs, and environments change.
    It encompasses maintainability, which refers to how easily the system can be
    updated or fixed, scalability, or how well the system can handle growth in users
    or data and reliability, meaning how consistently the system performs as expected.
